Child Safety Policy for All You Need a Video
Last Updated: August 23, 2025
All You Need a Video is a simple app designed for users aged 13 and older to share pre-viewed video links with friends via email or social media for download requests. We are committed to protecting children from sexual abuse and exploitation (CSAE) in compliance with Google Play's policies. Our child safety measures include:

Age Restriction: The app is not intended for users under 13 years of age and does not collect personal information from children, in compliance with the Children's Online Privacy Protection Act (COPPA).
No Hosted Content: The app does not host or create content. Users share external video links (e.g., YouTube, Vimeo) that they have already viewed, ensuring no inappropriate content is generated within the app.
Limited Social Interaction: Social media sharing (e.g., Twitter, Instagram) is user-initiated and limited to sharing video links with friends. The app does not support direct user-to-user communication or communities.
Content Safety: Users are responsible for the links they share. Any reports of inappropriate content can be sent to [your-email@example.com] for immediate review.
Compliance: We adhere to Google Play policies and applicable laws to ensure a safe environment.

For more details, please refer to our Privacy Policy.
Contact us at [your-email@example.com] with any concerns.          
